<section class="relative min-h-[100dvh] flex items-end pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img src="/images/hero-yunnan.webp" alt="Yunnan province dramatic landscape with mountains and terraced fields at sunrise" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/30 to-black/20"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white/90 mb-6">
      Independent guide &middot; No booking fees &middot; Updated August 2026
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] text-white max-w-4xl pb-1">Yunnan Province: China's Most Diverse Travel Destination</h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mt-6 leading-relaxed">Ancient towns built 1,300 years ago. Snow-capped peaks at 5,500m. Tropical rainforests teeming with wild elephants. And 25 ethnic cultures sharing their food, festivals, and way of life.</p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/60 max-w-xl">More than 1.2 million visitors each year. Easy high-speed trains, affordable guesthouses, and the best food in China you have not tried yet.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-8">
      <a href="#destinations" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-50 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">Explore Destinations <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></a>
      <a href="#getting-started" class="px-6 py-3 bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-full font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-700 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">Start Planning <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>